## Probation

A probation period of {{ probation_days }} days runs from the start date above,
under policy POL-001. The hiring manager files a written probation review before
that period ends, and confirmation of employment is never automatic.

## Week one

Mandatory information security and data-handling training must be completed
during your first calendar week (POL-002). Until it is passed, system access
stays read-only.
